            "epId": 4810,
            "name": "スネージナヤ",
            "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/09/75248538/ed15af576e851395f8910be6b2930d60_2101315134833108643.png"
          }
        ],
